> A comment before the first section.

***conformance tests***

# add-first-task
Adding a :Task: named "Buy milk" to an empty :TaskList: shows one :Task: named "Buy milk".
  - :App: prints `Added task 1: Buy milk`.

# add-without-name

given:
  - an empty :TaskList:
when:
  - :User: runs `todo add`
then:
  - stderr is `Error: name is required`
> A comment inside a body is dropped.
  - exit status is 1


# gherkin-shape
Scenario: adding a task with a note
  Given an empty :TaskList:
  When :User: adds "Buy milk"

  Then :TaskList: shows it

# links-the-notes
The output matches [the notes](notes.md).

***acceptance tests***

# add-then-list
- :User: adds a :Task: named "Buy milk".
- `todo list` shows `1 Buy milk`.
